{"server":"cn","storyId":"act30side_level_act30side_05_beg","groupId":"act30side","stageId":"act30side_05","title":"逃票？","storyCode":"RS-5","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act30side/level_act30side_05_beg.txt","sourceHash":"ac3fe81ad6b75a5fa3c50e4916b8393eb9171778181cfffde6195dd3ec22cf6e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g8_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事......？地上怎么这么多空酒瓶子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怪了，我怎么会睡在会客厅地板上？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳......好孩子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......阿克托斯......这个......混账东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（鼾声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吵什么！连个安稳觉都不让人睡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，慢着，我这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹！您什么时候回来的，怎么也不提前让人带话说一声？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天这是怎么回事，咱们怎么都睡到地上去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别瞎嚷嚷，吵得我头疼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，还有大老爷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，你们可算醒了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古罗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天这是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天老爷和大老爷都喝醉了，说是要不醉不休，说什么都不愿意回房间睡，我们怎么劝都不成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没办法，只好往炉子里多添了两把柴，这样至少不会冷着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，昨天的事你不记得了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......等会，你让我想想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天，昨天......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得，昨天我是要给耶拉冈德像落成仪式的前夜晚会做准备。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"圣女大人让我选出谢拉格最好的酒水，用来招待来客，所以我就挨个尝了尝......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，然后我就不大记得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你自然是不记得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你喝得烂醉连人都分不清，还抱着柱子要和人家干杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都多大年纪了，丢人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，爹，我这不也是为了圣女大人，为了谢拉格吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古罗还在这呢，你少骂我两句，给我留点面子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我从来都教你，面子里子都是自己挣的，光要我给你留有什么用！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，先不和你计较。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"古罗，怎么没瞧见罗莎琳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大老爷，罗莎琳小姐一早就上山去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳小姐醒得早，老爷和大老爷那会都还没醒，小姐就说，干脆让你们再睡会儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想着也是，就没喊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她就这样走了，也好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许，或许这就是耶拉冈德为我佩尔罗契家做出的安排。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见面不识，这是缘分未够，缘分未够啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，你这又打什么哑谜呢？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我隐约记得昨天是来了个小丫头没错，不过我确实是醉得不轻，不大想得起来那丫头的长相了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们说，那丫头叫罗莎琳？这名字......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，你过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此事，我不该瞒你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"便如当初，亦是你自己做了选择一般。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今该如何做，终究需你自己决断。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......耶拉冈德在上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这祖孙三代真的就喝了整整一宿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还把我和其他护卫一起拉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好久没有喝过这么多酒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"护卫？","speakerId":"avg_npc_283_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，真的一点正事都没说......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然侧面行不通，那么，干脆从正面来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看这个方向，罗莎琳小姐是往山上去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦——这就是雪山啊——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近看比远看还要更壮观，谢拉格的山还是有点真本事的嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，有点头晕，昨天真的喝多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道那老伯和大叔醒了没有，博士怎么没告诉我，谢拉格人竟然这么热情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等回头下山，再送点什么过去做谢礼吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，真冷，这风刮得人身上怪疼的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得......这山好像是得自己爬上去，才是对耶拉冈德信仰虔诚来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好高。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......难得来一次，那就试试好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪山上最纯净的空气？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来挺不错的，你们这能刷卡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，那我要两箱，直接送到驮峰酒店606号房。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明商人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客B","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"哇，佐菲娅姐姐，你又买这么多啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客B","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天你还买了四箱什么雪山泉水，这么多东西，我们要怎么带回去啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"傻！哪用我们自己带？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回头给玛恩纳和玛嘉烈各寄一部分，这么看我买得还不够多呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格的空气和水确实都不错，黑骑士当初选择了这里，现在日子应该也过得不错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不说这个。听说这谢拉格的雪山需要亲自攀爬登顶，才算虔诚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客A","speakerId":"avg_npc_064_weapon_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我们也试试！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客B","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"确实，这本旅游手册上也是这么写的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"外国游客B","speakerId":"avg_npc_061","isRemote":false,"text":"佐菲娅姐姐，我们来比一比，谁最先到山顶！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱利老爹，你咋不告诉她们，咱们已经有上山的缆车啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯嚯嚯，游客们有自己的主意，老头子就不过去添乱咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒也是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看这些游客还都挺喜欢爬山的，现在也就他们爱爬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，她们那些话说得也有道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走了！坐缆车去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真坐？这不算对耶拉冈德信仰不坚定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算什么算！这是耶拉冈德爱惜子民，才给咱们的便利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子若是还坚持不坐，那才是对耶拉冈德信仰不坚定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊什么啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们都是耶拉冈德的子民，只要你不对耶拉冈德不敬，心里想着耶拉冈德，耶拉冈德自然会保佑咱们的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好险，山上居然还有缆车可坐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么哪儿的景点都一个样......不跟着当地人走，就是容易吃点亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道到底怎么才算是对耶拉冈德信仰坚定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但看谢拉格眼下这情况，耶拉冈德应该还挺保佑这儿的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，前面的老人家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问缆车的票在哪买？劳您指个方向！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老先生，请留步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁？怎么这副打扮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是这样的，我是来自维多利亚的记者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然人们都说这耶拉冈德像好，但是，建造这种东西肯定是劳民伤财的，我正在收集一些——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我儿子每个月都会把钱寄回来，还会给我打电话，说在那边工作得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们这些外国人，就是见不得我们谢拉格的好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，他为什么不回来呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他说他签了一些什么什么协议，要在那边待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么协议来着？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格青年","speakerId":"avg_npc_277_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保密协议。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......建雕像也需要保密协议吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":"avg_npc_867_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我告诉你，外国佬，你要是想编派我们耶拉冈德，我现在就给你一拐杖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"谢拉格老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，人呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g1_snowyforest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哼哼哼，赞美耶拉冈德......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勇敢的驮兽~勇敢的人~耶拉冈德教导我们~护佑家园，哼哼~♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哼哼哼......♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这雪怎么有点不对劲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎哟！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这下面是个陷阱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没摔到吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，锏小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这哪来的坑......肯定是莱利那老家伙为了抓野味挖的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是多谢你啊锏小姐，要不是你，俺这肯定就踩空滑下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，不用客气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐今天要上山办事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么要俺们帮忙的不？俺和莱利、雷昂他们几个老家伙今儿约好了上山，有啥事尽管吩咐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是要上山有点事，但不用帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和老莱利还在和维多利亚人喝酒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，咱们两边拼酒，现在平局！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁都不服气咧，这喝酒要是输给那群维多利亚来的，多给恩希欧迪斯老爷，还有圣女大人丢脸啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且这维多利亚人突然跑来俺们这，还扎营住下了，你说这算什么事儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算俺没读过啥书，也知道突然乌泱泱来这么大群人，还个个五大三粗壮实得很，肯定不是什么好事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺和老莱利就想着，俺们借着一起喝酒，至少要替恩希欧迪斯老爷把这群人给盯住咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，锏小姐，咱们一定能赢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，能喝吐他们最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行就叫我，别太勉强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"盯着维多利亚人这事，是你们自己琢磨出来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，俺们和其他老乡一起想的主意。乡亲们都是同意的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在日子越来越好，大伙都知道好歹，谁都别想把俺们的好日子搅和咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过锏小姐，俺说句实在话，你别生气啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，你尽管说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是想说啊，俺们这不是和维多利亚来的一起喝酒嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这群维多利亚人，俺们这一个月也算是有些了解，别的不说，他们人其实真不坏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝醉了，也没给俺们添多少麻烦，平时偶尔还来帮着干点活啥的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有个和俺差不多年纪的老骨头，喝多了耍酒疯也不干别的，就脱了衣服要跳雪里游泳，俺就看他那背啊，没一块好肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不知道这是遭过多少罪，想想就疼得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这事你们知道也无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次这位维多利亚子爵阁下来庆贺耶拉冈德像落成，带来的人都是他手下的亲兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大多都是跟着他征战已久的老兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们只是一起喝酒，不必考虑太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。这什么亲兵不亲兵的，俺可搞不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过他们那群人确实看着年纪都不轻了，有几个小伙子，但看着好像身上都长了石头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那应该是之前宣传过的，那个什么石头病吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平日接触没什么，不用太紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，该有的防范还是要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以去罗德岛在城里的办事处，或者刚建好的医院，在那都能拿到防护手册。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，这些俺们懂，锏小姐别操心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺也就是和锏小姐多废话两句，要是恩希欧迪斯老爷和诺希斯老爷，那俺可不敢打扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说，我看起来很闲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺不是这个意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是，几位老爷成天忙大事儿，俺们也不好打扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"锏小姐虽然也忙，但平常总帮着俺们，俺们都知道你是跟俺们站一块的，那就是自己人嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自己人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也不对，哎，几位老爷也是自己人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俺嘴笨，反正就是那个意思！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是耽误锏小姐时间了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我这有件事要麻烦你，还有山上的老莱利他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一句话的事儿，尽管吩咐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"帮我找到一个装模作样的维多利亚人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"装模作样的维多利亚人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴着礼帽，穿黑色大衣，领子遮着脸，身上还挂着宝石装饰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"显眼得很，一眼就认得出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这人搞啥，在俺们谢拉格穿成这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"锏","speakerId":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概不怎么聪明吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行嘞，包在俺身上！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠闲的老乡","speakerId":"avg_npc_278_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一有消息，俺就让老雷昂家的驮兽给锏小姐你送过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g8_nobleroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，你说的是真的吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天的那丫头......罗莎琳她、她是我的女儿？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应当不会错。那孩子的长相，像你，也像塔季扬娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子眼还没花，不会认错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女儿......我的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！我就说那是个好丫头，长得也好，性子也好！好啊，好丫头！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳，罗莎琳......她长得像我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对，是像我，我想起来了，那丫头是棕色头发，和我一样！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼睛嘴巴都像塔季扬娜，特别是眼睛，和塔季扬娜一模一样！多好看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这时间过得真快，一转眼小罗莎琳都长这么大了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，罗莎琳上山去了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那她什么时候回来？她还回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，还有件事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爹，我得去给我闺女准备点礼物，有什么事回头再说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得她小的时候最喜欢烤甜奶酪，还有兽肉炖菜，我现在就去买！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有塔季扬娜，塔季扬娜是不是也来了？她是不是不愿意见我？那我、我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！不管了，我直接上山一趟，把东西给罗莎琳送过去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后再问问她塔季扬娜的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，爹，我得抓紧点时间——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我站住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你站住，还有些事，你得知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿克托斯被父亲喝止在原地，心中不禁生出些许不好的预感。\n或许是宿醉的缘故，他忽然感到头痛难忍，胃沉沉下坠，冷意不知从哪里钻出，爬上背脊。\n阿克托斯此时才发现许久未见的父亲背脊已略微佝偻，不复记忆中的高大，像株逐渐枯萎的大树。\n年老的修士那干枯的声音并未因阿克托斯的心慌而停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳那孩子说，她和母亲一起离开后，一直定居在乌萨斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那孩子离开的时候太小了，还记不住事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她说这么些年，她从来不知父亲是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这趟回来，除了要好好看看咱们的耶拉冈德像，还有就是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送她母亲的遗物回来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"坏的预感似乎总会成真。\n屋外呼啸的风雪，屋内跳动的炉火，连带分不出属于谁的呼吸声似乎都短暂地静止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗物......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可、可塔季扬娜还那么年轻，怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不可能......这怎么可能......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子亲耳所闻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，当年的事......是我们佩尔罗契家对不住她们母女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子心中有愧，却无悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿克托斯，你又如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，不管你要说什么，与我说都无用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爹我不是完人，也不是圣人，更不是受害者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老头子老了，听不了你要说的话，更指点不了你什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"惟愿今后日日清扫耶拉冈德足下尘土，以此度过余生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老修士","speakerId":"avg_npc_1160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......自己好好想想吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塔季扬娜......罗莎琳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷，大老爷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_260_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菈塔托丝夫人来访，说有急事要谈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，好大的酒味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天就是仪式了，阿克托斯，你可别现在喝酒误事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在没心情和你唱戏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说吧，出什么事了。没事你菈塔托丝可不会登门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，你对我倒是很了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行了，那我就直说了，阿克托斯，我是来给你提个醒的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得，当年你阿克托斯不顾家里人反对，娶了一个乌萨斯女人，还生了一个女儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之后希瓦艾什夫妇出事，没多久你的妻子和女儿便离开谢拉格，这事在咱们三家范围内，可是无人不知啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，你的鼻子还是这么灵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就当你是在夸我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我这次来，就是要和你说说你的女儿，那个叫罗莎琳的姑娘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗莎琳她怎么了，你少借题发挥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿克托斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_254_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她和我们三家的事扯不上关系！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对翻旧账没兴趣，只不过，她回来的时机实在不巧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道这姑娘现在在哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菈塔托丝","speakerId":"avg_npc_253_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她很可能已经被维多利亚的密探盯上了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g12_mountpath"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缆车只能到这儿了，接下来还是得自己爬啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也行吧，离山顶也不远了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚还能看到几个游客的，到这儿就完全没人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上下左右都是白茫茫的......嘶，怎么还有点吓人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不......运气......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什、什么声音？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......自从到了谢拉格，就没一件事顺利过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁在前面！出、出来！休想吓唬我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前面那是......是个坑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁这么无聊在路边挖坑，不对，这肯定不是单纯的坑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"烈夏","speakerId":"avg_194_leto_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是陷阱！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，没错。这是个陷阱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这位小姐，小心脚下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“灰礼帽”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以及，如果方便的话，可以麻烦您顺便将我拉上来吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
